<title>USA: American TeleSource completes $2.4 mln conversion.</title>
<headline>American TeleSource completes $2.4 mln conversion.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>American TeleSource International Inc said on Tuesday that it had completed the conversion of 2,405,125 warrants associated with previous financing, generating proceeds of more than $2.4 million.</p>
<p>The networks provider also said a San Antonio investment group had acquire roughly $2.0 million of common stock from the company.</p>
<p>American TeleSource currently trades under the symbol ATIL.CDN on the Canadian Dealing Network in Toronto.</p>
